#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A free IBM course on utility-scale quantum computing featuring realistic use"
" cases and best practices"
msgstr ""
"Isang libreng kurso ng IBM tungkol sa utility-scale quantum computing na may"
" mga realistic na use case at pinakamahusay na mga gawi"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
