msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Pangkalahatang-ideya {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/use-a-qc-today/hero.svg)\n"
msgstr "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/use-a-qc-today/hero.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Welcome to *Use a quantum computer today*! In the course, you'll start using"
" a quantum computer immediately, and learn the basic principles of quantum "
"computing along the way.\n"
msgstr ""
"Maligayang pagdating sa *Use a quantum computer today*! Sa kurso, "
"magsisimula kang gumamit ng quantum computer agad, at matututuhan ang mga "
"pangunahing prinsipyo ng quantum computing habang tumatakbo ang kurso.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is designed for the curious and the busy. You don't need a "
"physics degree or years of programming experience. If you can follow along "
"with a notebook and click \"Run,\" you're ready.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang kursong ito ay para sa mga mausisa at sa mga abalang tao. Hindi mo "
"kailangan ng degree sa physics o maraming taon ng karanasan sa programming. "
"Kung kaya mong sumunod sa isang notebook at mag-click ng \"Run,\" handa ka "
"na.\n"
